v-EMU modifications:
- 1280x800 default boot resolution for x64, aarch64 and riscv64.
- QemuRamfbDxe mode list and default 1280x800 (fw_cfg override kept).
- v-EMU boot logo and boot-manager strings.
- TPM 2.0 enabled for x64, aarch64 and riscv64 builds.
- x64 Secure Boot build with SMM, plus a dual-CA (2011+2023) VARS template
  derived from the stock Fedora 44 OVMF_VARS_4M.secboot image (format
  conversion only; no certificates added or removed).
- FD_SIZE/flash packaging as described in README.md.

The TianoCore logo is not included. The v-EMU logo in boot-logo.bmp is
original artwork for this project.

EDK II copyright notices and license headers are retained in the source
patches. Binary redistribution includes the license texts in this directory.
